<title>CANADA: Greyhound Canada July 31 Q3 net drops.</title>
<headline>Greyhound Canada July 31 Q3 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two-month third quarter ended July 31</p>
<p>				1996			 1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.12		   C$0.29</p>
<p> Net			  1,100		    2,430</p>
<p> Revs			36,764		   33,001</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,412		    8,412</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Greyhound Canada Transportation Corp.</p>
<p>It is reporting for a two-month period due to restructuring. Nine-month results not available.</p>
<p>Greyhound Canada is carrying the transportation business of Greyhound Lines of Canada Ltd since May 31 and reconciling different year end periods. The 1995 period of Greyhound Lines' results was restated for comparison purposes.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
